Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赶快挂掉电话 -  好的 马上就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just hang up the phone. -  Okay, I'll wrap it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.69,0:08:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 贝瑟尼 现在就挂掉 -  再聊2分钟就讲完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bethany, hang it up now. -  Two minutes and we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那就课后留校吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's detention.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.17,0:08:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好 摆动你们的双臂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, keep those arms pumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,动起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.11,0:08:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,贝瑟尼 你迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bethany, you're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.47,0:08:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说她和那个踢足球的分手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard she broke up with that football guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.44,0:08:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就有机会追她了 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could be your opening, Fussfeld.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 现在我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna practice
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,练习接球和投掷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}catching and throwing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,两人一组 拿上球 动起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So partner up and grab a football. Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.65,0:08:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 玛莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Martha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.86,0:08:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,玛莎 你一个人练不了接球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Martha. You can't play catch by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.43,0:08:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快点去组队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pair up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.13,0:08:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.69,0:08:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不用了 我挺好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须像其他同学那样参与进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to participate just like everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.30,0:09:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你来这里干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise, why are you even here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.61,0:09:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这是门必修课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a requirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.85,0:09:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 玛莎 -  我觉得这毫无意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Martha... -  I think it's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.47,0:09:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,体育课不会帮助我进入普林斯顿大学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gym class is not gonna get me into Princeton,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我也不太了解 那种进球之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I don't understand the obsession with throwing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.68,0:09:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,疯狂呐喊的人 噢 触地得分 5分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a ball into a hoop and, "Touchdown, five points!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的太离谱了 但 首先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. There's a lot wrong with that, but first of all...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这是体育锻炼 对你的身体有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's physical activity, which is good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.59,0:09:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有助于你同别人交流 这对你也是有好处的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With other people, also good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.79,0:09:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你试一试 也许会体验到乐趣呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you try it, you might even have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,乐趣 就是为了这个么 为了乐趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fun. That's what we're doing here? Fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是学校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.60,0:09:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来这是为了学习更有用的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are supposed to be learning things that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.23,0:09:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 -  我们一生没有多少时间可以浪费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, Martha... -  We don't have
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.53,0:09:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我也不想虚度年华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a lot of time in this life, and I personally
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,以后当一个体育老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't wanna waste it on being, like, a gym teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我说错了 -  是的 你当然说错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That... That came out wrong. -  Yeah, it sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你课后留校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's detention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴挺硬啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was hard-core.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.82,0:09:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,斯宾塞·吉尔平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spencer Gilpin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,坐吧 斯宾塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a seat, Spencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,马瑟斯老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Mathers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这种国家例外论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"And it was this sense of national exceptionalism
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,使得西进运动的星星之火成燎原之势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that fueled the spreading wildfire of westward expansion."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.94,0:10:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这话是不是挺耳熟 吉尔平先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that sound familiar, Mr. Gilpin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有啊 -  这是安东尼关于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It does not. -  It's the last sentence
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.21,0:10:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,西进运动论文的最后一句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Anthony's paper on westward expansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.41,0:10:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,巧合的是 这跟你去年在韦勃教授课上写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, coincidentally, it's the last sentence
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.88,0:10:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,西进运动论文的最后一句话一模一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of your paper on westward expansion from last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.95,0:10:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.82,0:10:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.60,0:10:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得是的 我的意思是 竟然会这么巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think so. I mean, what are the odds of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.86,0:10:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你在文章中多次使用了这个"燎原之火"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you also used the same metaphor:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这个暗喻 比如\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The spreading wildfire," in your papers
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,在波士顿倾茶事件的论文 葛底斯堡战役的论文 以及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the Boston Tea Party, the Battle of Gettysburg,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,妇女选举权运动的论文中都有这句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the women's suffrage movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这个用法本来就很普遍嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so hot in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,安东尼 我知道你很想通过我这门课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anthony, I know how much you need to pass my class,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可你不能帮他写论文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this is not how you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不会容忍作弊的 -  作弊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I will not tolerate cheating. -  Cheating?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.59,0:11:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有作弊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't... I didn't... I didn't cheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.85,0:11:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我让他这样干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made him do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你让他 找你替他写论文?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made him... have you write his paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.73,0:11:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 可以吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. I'm sorry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.47,0:11:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 这样是不行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, it's not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 你搞得我差点被踢出足球队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell, man? You got me kicked off the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.34,0:11:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你搞得我差点被开除呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, you could've gotten me expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.44,0:11:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,现在大祸临头的不止你一个吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like you're the only one who's living dangerously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.35,0:11:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大祸临头? -  是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Living dangerously? -  Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我长这么大从来没冒过险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the most dangerous thing I've ever done in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.55,0:11:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我要付出代价了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now look at me. I'm paying the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.03,0:11:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那么..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这里挺热闹的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}isn't this a fun group?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎留校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to detention.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.76,0:11:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 斯宾塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Spencer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.97,0:12:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想说我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna say that I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 -  本特利校长 我只是打了个电话而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. -  Bentley, all I did was make...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.96,0:12:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,贝瑟尼 你们留校 都是有原因的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bethany, please. You're all here for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你们心里清楚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.81,0:12:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你们应该想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this is what you should be thinking about:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.03,0:12:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.07,0:12:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就好好想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in this moment in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要成为什么样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and who you want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.77,0:12:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你的一生如何度过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get one life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.08,0:12:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,由你自己做主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You decide how you're gonna spend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.31,0:12:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,幸运的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortunately...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.95,0:12:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,留校查看处 是最适合你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is no better place for self-reflection
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.99,0:12:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,自我反省的地方了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than detention.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.46,0:12:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,站起来 各位 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up, everybody. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这里要改造成新的电脑室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are turning this into a new computer center.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.97,0:12:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但在改造之前 要打扫干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But before we do, it has to be cleaned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.61,0:12:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所有这些旧杂志 都要运到废品回收站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These old magazines are bound for the recycling plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但在回收之前都要整理好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they have to be prepped before they go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.01,0:12:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这些杂志上的订书钉都要卸下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems all the staples must be removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.85,0:13:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们今天做不完的话 明天接着做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you don't finish today, you finish tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明天是周六 -  就因为我不想踢足球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tomorrow's Saturday. -  Because I wouldn't play?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得这是不可能的 -  对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't think that'll work. -  That's fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.85,0:13:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 -  我建议你们快点开工吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut up. -  So I suggest you get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.95,0:13:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你们的工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Choose your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.83,0:13:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 他们在这放个保龄球干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what the hell they need with a bowling ball?
