Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.95,0:20:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.99,0:20:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 贝瑟尼 贝瑟尼 别去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, Bethany. Bethany, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.89,0:20:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.83,0:20:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我是一个肥胖的中年男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an overweight, middle-aged man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.19,0:20:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个文身 我妈一直告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, I have a tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.90,0:20:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我去纹文身 她就要把我杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mom always said she'd kill me if I ever got a tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.77,0:20:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.14,0:20:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有一个文身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,若隐若现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,慢着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手机呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.78,0:21:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我要在丛林里穿着这一身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why am I wearing this outfit in a jungle?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.85,0:21:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,超短裤和皮革的露脐装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tiny, little shorts and a leather halter top.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这一身衣服搞什么鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.82,0:21:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我还成了花园里的一个活侏儒呢 我的手机呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I look like a living garden gnome. Where is my phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.19,0:21:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁管你 -  我们都附在别人身上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who cares? -  We are in different bodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.80,0:21:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,找手机似乎不是 现在最紧急的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't seem like the most pressing concern at this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 你不觉得现在应该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? You don't think
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.16,0:21:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,去打个电话么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this would be a good moment to make a call
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.23,0:21:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,给别人发消息 或者把你的状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or text somebody or change your status
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.13,0:21:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,改成 困在一个该死的电子游戏里 吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to "stuck in a video game"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.46,0:21:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我身上没带我的抗过敏药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I'm saying is, I don't have my Claritin, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.87,0:21:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我几乎对所有东西过敏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm allergic to almost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.81,0:21:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.14,0:21:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你过敏啊 斯宾塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got allergies, Spencer? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.87,0:21:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好惨哦 我还矮了两英尺呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have the top two feet of my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.88,0:21:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,大家 这一切一定不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys, this can't actually be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们都昏迷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we're all in a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.14,0:21:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人 我们所有人一起昏迷了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together? We're all in a coma together?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是唯一的解释了 那个旧游戏机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only explanation. That old game machine
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.41,0:21:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是让我们触电了 现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}must have electrocuted us, and now we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.56,0:21:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的天 贝瑟尼 -  我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God, Bethany! -  Oh, my God, oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.23,0:22:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊 你最好下去救她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God! You better get in there and go save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.17,0:22:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不要下去 你去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not getting in there! You get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.07,0:22:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪都不去 我背着包呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going anywhere. I got a backpack on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.11,0:22:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能带着背包下水 是个人都知道这道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't get in water with a backpack. Everybody knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.11,0:22:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 贝瑟尼 -  发生什么...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bethany! -  What just...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.32,0:22:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.55,0:22:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那太刺激了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was so intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.92,0:22:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉 甚至无法动弹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, like, can't even with this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.90,0:22:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 刚才发生了什么 -  一头犀牛把我吃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What just happened to you? -  I got eaten by a rhino,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.19,0:22:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我从几百米的高空掉了下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then I fell, like, a thousand feet from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.93,0:22:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 看起来是这么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's what it looked like.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.63,0:22:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那是河马 它们是杂食性动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a hippo. They're omnivorous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.54,0:22:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,在陆地上跑起来像马一样快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're fast as a horse over short distances,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.03,0:22:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,咬合力达到八千一百牛顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they have the bite force of 8100 newtons.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.14,0:22:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.34,0:22:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你是动物学专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're an expert in zoology.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.87,0:22:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 -  我还是一个胖胖的老男人是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? -  I'm still an old fat guy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.64,0:22:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 恐怕是这样 -  等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm afraid so. -  Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.18,0:23:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么能这么淡定 我是说她从天上掉了下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is everybody okay with this? I mean, she fell out of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.44,0:23:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.62,0:23:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,贝瑟尼 起来 贝瑟尼 快起来 起来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bethany, get up. Bethany, get up. Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,勇石博士 欢迎来到尤曼吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah! Dr. Bravestone! Welcome to Jumanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.94,0:23:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,别傻站在那 快上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't just stand there. In you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.50,0:23:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,走走走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.26,0:23:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,勇石博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Bravestone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.59,0:23:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,著名的考古学家和国际探险家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Famed archaeologist and international explorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.62,0:23:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你是一位有胆识的专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Known across the seven continents
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.26,0:23:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,事迹传遍了七大洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for your courageous exploits.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.13,0:23:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这有安全带吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a seat belt?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.09,0:24:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不得不说 见到你真是荣幸之至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you what an honor it is to finally meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.20,0:24:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 我也不怕你笑话 你本人比我想象的更潇洒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not embarrassed to say you're more dashing in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.54,0:24:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,额 多谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.57,0:24:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.67,0:24:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,奈吉尔·比林斯利为您服务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nigel Billingsly at your service,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.31,0:24:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你是铁拳萝比 少男杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ruby Roundhouse, killer of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.58,0:24:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到尤曼吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Jumanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.27,0:24:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这恭候您多时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been so anxious for your arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.51,0:24:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,各位都知道 尤曼吉处于生死存亡之际\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you know, Jumanji is in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.61,0:24:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们指望着你们四位能解除诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're counting on the four of you to lift the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.51,0:24:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 诅咒 -  什么诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Curse? -  What curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.25,0:24:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 你看到我的手机了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Have you seen my phone anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.42,0:24:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,谢尔顿·奥布伦教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor Sheldon Oberon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.02,0:24:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到尤曼吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Jumanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.55,0:24:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,奈吉尔·比林斯利为您服务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nigel Billingsly at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.49,0:24:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这恭候您多时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been so anxious for your arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.10,0:24:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这人是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.62,0:24:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他是个NPC\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he's an NPC.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.43,0:24:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么 说人话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A what? English, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.97,0:24:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一个非玩家角色 他是游戏里设定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A non-player character. He's part of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.07,0:24:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,所以不管我们问了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So anything we ask him,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.44,0:24:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他都按照编好的程序回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he only has his programmed series of responses.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.73,0:24:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了 现在都清楚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it. It's all clear now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.47,0:24:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,耗子富兰克林·芬巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Franklin "Mouse" Finbar.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.68,0:24:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到尤曼吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Jumanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.24,0:24:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是毛子 不是耗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Moose. It's not Mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.07,0:24:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的 先生 我敢肯定是叫耗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, good sir. I'm quite sure it's Mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.58,0:24:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 耗子 -  就是因为您个子小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mouse? -  A nickname given
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.15,0:24:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,讨人喜欢 才有这个绰号的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for your diminutive stature and adorable manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.01,0:25:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你肯定在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.18,0:25:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,勇石博士不管到哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Bravestone doesn't go anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.02,0:25:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,都会带着他可靠的跟班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without his trusty sidekick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.72,0:25:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,跟班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sidekick?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.33,0:25:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,自从勇石博士在秘鲁丛林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever since Dr. Bravestone rescued you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.32,0:25:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,把你从军阀手中解救出来后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the clutches of a warlord
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.72,0:25:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你就跟他形影不离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the jungles of Peru, you've never left his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.56,0:25:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.73,0:25:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是说说那个诅咒的事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we go back to the curse thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.47,0:25:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这都写在 我寄给你的信上了 勇石博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all documented in the letter I sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.00,0:25:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你应该大声读出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you should read it aloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.60,0:25:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have a let...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.44,0:25:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.14,0:25:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,勇石博士 我写信来是为了告诉您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dr. Bravestone, I am writing to you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.48,0:25:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,尤曼吉已经危在旦夕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"regarding the desperate situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.58,0:25:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在需要你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In Jumanji. We need your help at once."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.39,0:25:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇 伙伴们 -  出什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa... Guys? -  What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.35,0:25:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.32,0:25:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这是一个过场动画 很多游戏中都有类似情节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a cut scene. A lot of games have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.69,0:25:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就是介绍故事背景的那种小片段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a little movie to tell you the back-story.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.49,0:25:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字叫奈吉尔·比林斯利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Nigel Billingsly,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.60,0:25:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,尤曼吉的向导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jumanji field guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.10,0:25:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾受雇于你以前的搭档\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hired by your former partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.16,0:25:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,现在的死敌 罗素 范 佩尔特教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now nemesis, Professor Russel Van Pelt
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.80,0:25:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,雇佣了一支忠诚的寻宝队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to lead a fateful expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.24,0:26:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,其实 范 佩尔特教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, Professor Van Pelt
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.31,0:26:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他曾经在寻找丛林里的美洲豹神像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had come in search of the fabled Jaguar Shrine,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.65,0:26:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,神圣的尤曼吉宝石所藏之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}resting place of the sacred jewel of Jumanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.31,0:26:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you know better than anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.35,0:26:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他对那宝石无比痴迷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the jewel was his great obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.18,0:26:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,经过多年的探索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And after years of research, he believed
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.39,0:26:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他认为自己终于找到了宝石的所在地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he had discovered its whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.38,0:26:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.15,0:26:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have I finally found it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.26,0:26:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,范·佩尔特告诉我 他找到宝石是为了用文字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Van Pelt told me that he wanted to find the jewel
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.46,0:26:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,记录下它的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order to document it in his writings.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.40,0:26:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它是真的 -  可我万万没想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's real! -  What I did not know
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.73,0:26:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他其实是想把宝石占为己有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was that he intended to take the jewel for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.51,0:26:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.14,0:26:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.82,0:26:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,根据传说 美洲豹神像一直守护着尤曼吉丛林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legend tells that the Jaguar watches over Jumanji
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.29,0:26:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谁取走神像的宝石之眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and anyone who dares to blind him
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.46,0:27:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,谁就会被黑恶力量吞噬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be consumed by a dark power.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.16,0:27:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,范·佩尔特拥有操纵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Van Pelt assumed dominion
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.16,0:27:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,丛林中所有生物的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over all of Jumanji's creatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.26,0:27:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他能操控它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}possessing them, controlling them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.56,0:27:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕的诅咒降临到了这片祥和的土地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a terrible curse befell this once-placid land.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.58,0:27:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我求他把宝石放回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I begged him to put it back,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.60,0:27:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,可他既然拿到了宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but once he had it in his grasp,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.74,0:27:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就决不会放手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he could never let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.55,0:27:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那天夜里 我等他们都睡着了之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I waited till they slept that night,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.68,0:27:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,就动手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I made my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.27,0:27:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,去把我的宝石追回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me that jewel!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.61,0:27:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,谁敢阻拦 格杀勿论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And slaughter anyone who tries to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.24,0:28:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,宝石在此 给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, then. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.61,0:28:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要团结协作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the invaluable help of your associates,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.15,0:28:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,运用各自的技能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you must use your complementary skills
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.91,0:28:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,把宝石放回美洲豹神像的眼睛上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to return the jewel to the Jaguar's eye
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.88,0:28:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,然后解除诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and lift the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.26,0:28:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你们肯定迫不及待跃跃欲试了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you'll want to get started right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.59,0:28:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 其实我 -  祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Actually, I think... -  Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.49,0:28:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,尤曼吉丛林的命运掌握在你们手中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fate of Jumanji is in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.56,0:28:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 -  记住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? Oh... -  And remember:
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.30,0:28:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏目标我解读\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The goal for you, I'll recite in verse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.53,0:28:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,归还宝石 打破诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return the jewel and lift the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.17,0:28:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,欲回故乡 拯救丛林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you wish to leave the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.74,0:28:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,大喊一声尤曼吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must save Jumanji And call out its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.30,0:28:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你们好运 尤曼吉丛林的命运掌握在你们手中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck! The fate of Jumanji is in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.28,0:28:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 记住 游戏目标 -  他又开始重复了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And remember: -  He's saying the same thing over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.61,0:28:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏目标我解读\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll recite in verse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.24,0:28:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,归还宝石 打破诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return the jewel and lift the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.38,0:28:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,欲回故乡 拯救丛林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you wish to leave the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.58,0:28:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,大喊一声尤曼吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must save Jumanji And call out its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.56,0:28:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 你能搞定的 现实中你人见人爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. You can handle this. In real life, people love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.32,0:28:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,跟谁都能谈情说爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can hook up with anyone you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.86,0:28:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你害怕的时候就是这么安慰自己的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what you tell yourself when you're scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.53,0:28:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能消停一会儿 别对我冷嘲热讽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you not judge me for two seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.90,0:29:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚刚跟诺亚分手 还变成了个大叔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I split up with Noah, I turned into a guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.93,0:29:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,连自己的手机都找不到 我难过一会儿不行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I cannot find my phone. I am allowed to be upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.67,0:29:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,勇石博士 这是丛林的地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Bravestone, here's a map of Jumanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.81,0:29:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你得去集市找到缺失的那部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must go to the bazaar and find the missing piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.57,0:29:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 集市 -  什么缺失的部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The bazaar. -  Missing piece of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.64,0:29:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再会 -  等等 就不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cheerio! -  You can't give us a ride
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.65,0:29:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 开车直接送我们去神像那边吗 - 别忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- to the statue? -  And remember:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.61,0:29:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,欲回故乡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you wish to leave the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.58,0:29:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,拯救丛林 大喊一声尤曼吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must save Jumanji And call out its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.76,0:29:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这个先放你包里 - 不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want to, uh, put this in there? -  No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.32,0:29:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 冰箱 只有你 有背包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you're the only one with a backpack, Fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.36,0:29:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢 我们有一张地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what? We have a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.97,0:29:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,现在要去找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now we're supposed to go and find...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.96,0:29:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我想 是要找到集市吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bazaar, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.47,0:29:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我们把宝石放回美洲豹神像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we return the jewel to the Jaguar statue,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.41,0:29:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就可以回家了 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then we go home. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.93,0:29:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,就不能直接离开吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't we just leave, stop the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.87,0:29:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不想玩这破游戏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without doing all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.94,0:29:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须完成这个游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to finish the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.67,0:29:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.51,0:30:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须拯救丛林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we have to save Jumanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.50,0:30:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 他可真有男人味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, that is a man right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.70,0:30:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,别哭 别哭 别哭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't cry, don't cry, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.93,0:30:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,别哭 别哭 别哭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.47,0:30:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,传染源可真多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are so many diseases out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.27,0:30:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真够热的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.71,0:30:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这是我擅长的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, this is what I'm good at.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.94,0:30:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,玩电子游戏 这方面我算老手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Playing video games. It's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.34,0:30:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上我每天都在玩游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's literally the main thing that I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.62,0:30:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,玩这样的电子游戏 肯定要闯关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play a game like this, there'll be levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.68,0:30:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,要想结束游戏 就要闯过所有关卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In order to finish, you gotta complete all the levels.
