Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.94,0:48:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,省省吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, stop doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.67,0:48:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 这也太好吃了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, this is so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.28,0:48:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我九岁开始就没吃过面包了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't had bread since I was, like, 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.28,0:48:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.42,0:48:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我怎么会这么苗条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you think I got these abs?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.51,0:48:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来尝尝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me try some of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.39,0:48:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 这 这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, what... What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.72,0:48:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我最拿手的蛋糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my famous pound cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.99,0:48:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,蛋糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.23,0:48:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,贝瑟尼 你之前说这是面包的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bethany, you said this was bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.70,0:48:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得可能是太久没吃了 搞混了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been so long, I forgot what it tastes like.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.30,0:48:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么能搞混\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you forget what...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.77,0:48:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快看我 我有什么变化吗 -  没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's hap... Something happening to me? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.97,0:48:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我 我 我有没有颤抖 -  没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-  Am I... Am I shaking? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.51,0:48:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我有起疹子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I breaking out?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.97,0:48:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.84,0:48:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我皮肤还是黑色的吧 -  是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Am I still black? -  Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.01,0:48:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 是的 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.71,0:48:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我很正常 一切正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're fine. Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.88,0:48:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 弱点可能是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, no, no, no, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.38,0:48:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我特喜欢吃蛋糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It probably just meant that I love cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.35,0:48:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,完全抗拒不了它的美味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I couldn't resist it. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.31,0:48:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 一切都好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it's all good...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.79,0:49:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.90,0:49:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell? Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.97,0:49:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过的 要保持谨慎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said, important to be discreet.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.90,0:49:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你还说过我们该吃东西呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you also said eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.37,0:49:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,面包 新鲜的面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rations! Get your...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.01,0:49:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好给我闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better shut your ass up!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.34,0:49:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 勇石博士 你来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Bravestone. Thank goodness you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.75,0:49:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,尤曼吉需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jumanji needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.95,0:49:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 很荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh. Thanks. Good to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.68,0:49:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,问他关于地图的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask about the missing piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.35,0:49:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哦对 嗨 我是贝瑟尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, right. Hi. I'm Bethany.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.49,0:49:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我是谢利教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean... Professor Shelly, something.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.66,0:49:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我是一个地图专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a map doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.05,0:49:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在手上有一张地图 缺了一块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I have this map that, like, has a missing piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.63,0:49:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 勇石博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Bravestone. Thank goodness you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.00,0:49:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你来了 尤曼吉需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jumanji needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.33,0:49:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,真没礼貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.60,0:49:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要找到缺的那块地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to find the missing piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.90,0:50:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,"所需之物 就在篮中"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you need is in the basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.53,0:50:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,"稍有不慎 万丈深渊"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One false move, you're in a casket.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.34,0:50:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,信任彼此 请勿眨眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust one another, and never blink.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.67,0:50:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,寻得残片 远不止此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The missing piece is not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.65,0:50:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oy vey.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.88,0:50:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运 强大的英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck, mighty hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.78,0:50:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尤曼吉需要你 -  我们知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jumanji needs you. -  Jumanji needs him. We know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.08,0:50:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过很多遍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said it several times.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.69,0:50:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我觉得里面可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So thinking there's a, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.66,0:50:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有条蛇 或者什么其他的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A snake in there or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.13,0:50:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.56,0:51:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来这活适合你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like a Bravestone thing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.47,0:51:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么听起来就适合我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would this be a Bravestone thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.37,0:51:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你是强大的英雄 你听到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the hero. You heard what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.13,0:51:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他说的了 尤曼吉需要你 上啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Jumanji needs you." Now, get.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.52,0:51:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想做这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.39,0:51:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快点吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.94,0:51:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,黑曼巴蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black mamba!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.44,0:51:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是一条黑曼巴蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a black mamba.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.41,0:51:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,零点二五毫克的毒液就足以杀死一个成年人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A quarter milligram of its venom is enough to kill an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.94,0:51:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如果被它咬了 会感觉嘴里有刺痛感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll feel a tingling in your mouth and extremities,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.15,0:51:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,紧接着是发烧 呕吐及共济失调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}followed by a fever, foaming at the mouth, and ataxia,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.69,0:51:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是肌肉失去控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which means loss of muscle control.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.45,0:52:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我怎么会知道这些的 -  我们现在怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do I know that? -  What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.02,0:52:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看见里面有什么其他的东西吗 -  我没来得及看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See anything else in there? -  I didn't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.49,0:52:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的天 -  好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God. -  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.89,0:52:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 信任彼此 请勿眨眼 不要眨眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Trust one another and never blink." Never blink.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.59,0:52:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 各位 我觉得这是一个瞪眼比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys, I think it's a staring contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.66,0:52:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 -  你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? -  What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.17,0:52:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 想想 请勿眨眼 -  各位 我觉得她是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Think about it. "Never blink"? -  Guys, I think she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.09,0:52:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,夏令营的老师告诉过我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At camp, they used to tell us
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.76,0:52:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你碰见响尾蛇 千万不能动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you see a rattlesnake, don't move. I think someone
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.07,0:52:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得得有人来盯着蛇的眼睛 不能眨眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has to make direct eye contact and not blink.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.77,0:52:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,然后斯宾塞把手伸进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then Spencer will reach in and grab
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.70,0:52:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把里面的东西拿出来 -  什么 为什么 又是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- whatever else is in there. -  What? Why me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.17,0:52:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为你是勇石博士啊 -  好吧 我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Because you're Bravestone. -  Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.51,0:52:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那谁擅长这个瞪眼游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's good at staring and not blinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.81,0:52:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这个我很擅长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm amazing at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.08,0:52:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那么现在就看你的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then this is your moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.18,0:52:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 贝瑟尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Bethany.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.80,0:52:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你说开始就开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just say when.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.80,0:52:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.15,0:53:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.97,0:53:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你要拔掉它的毒牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta defang it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.18,0:53:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我要干啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta what?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.82,0:53:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你得从它的视觉盲区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta pull his mouth back
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.52,0:53:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,钳住它的嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the blind spot to disorient it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.49,0:53:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你要非常小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But be very careful of the venom gland
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.49,0:53:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰到它的毒腺和二级毒眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the exposed secondary venom duct.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.60,0:53:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,然后把毒牙从头部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you gotta snap its teeth...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.70,0:53:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,干净利落的拔出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...out of its head.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.97,0:53:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这不是瞪眼比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess it wasn't a staring contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.70,0:53:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,信任彼此 请勿眨眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Trust each other and never blink."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.97,0:53:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们信任我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You trusted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.04,0:53:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你们信任我 所以我才能拔掉蛇的毒牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You trusted me, and I defanged the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.24,0:53:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我做到了 我做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did it. I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.18,0:53:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah, you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.81,0:53:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.25,0:53:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.15,0:54:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.79,0:54:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这不像是地图上缺的那块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This does not look like a piece of a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.26,0:54:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,缺失的部分是一只大象吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The missing piece is an elephant?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.69,0:54:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 包装纸上写了些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, wait, there's something written on the wrapping paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.67,0:54:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,见我之时 攀登开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"When you see me, begin the climb."
