Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.21,0:57:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我看见你们在集市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I saw you guys in the bazaar,
