Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.17,0:58:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 那就是我 - 你什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, that's me. -  Wait a minute.
