Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.02,1:03:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 斯宾塞 你不喝那杯玛格丽特了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Spencer, you gonna drink that margarita?
