Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.25,1:03:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他已经醉了 -  我就喝了三小杯鸡尾酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He is drunk. -  I had three little margaritas.
