Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.81,1:04:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,拖住他们 然后我们趁机溜进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and hold their attention while we sneak in.
