Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.87,1:05:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟我来吧 女孩 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, girl. -  Okay.
