Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.61,1:05:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要给我和玛莎准备一顿烛光晚餐 那到底是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}candlelight dinner. What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.92,1:05:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那个女孩喜欢你 斯宾塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl is into you, Spencer.
