Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.12,1:17:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行 -  告诉我怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes! -  Tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.55,1:17:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你要把斜板控制杆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta connect the flight-control rod
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.82,1:17:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,接到旋翼下面的网格板上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the mesh plate under the rotors.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.26,1:17:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,斜板控制杆 网格板 在旋翼下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flight-control rod, mesh plate, under the rotors.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.00,1:17:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 -  我马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait, what? -  I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.96,1:18:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 斯宾塞 你要去哪 -  赶紧的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Spencer, where are you going? -  Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.97,1:18:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小心些 -  别乱来 快快快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Be careful! -  No, no, just hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.50,1:18:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我只要站在这上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, just gonna stand on this thingy,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.17,1:18:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,靠近这些致命的直升机桨叶 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pull myself up towards these deadly helicopter blades. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.33,1:18:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,看到网格板了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's the mesh plate.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.41,1:18:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这是控制杆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's that rod thingy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.06,1:18:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 斯宾塞 喔 -  快点 亚历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Spencer! -  Speed it up, Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.20,1:18:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,斯宾塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spencer!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.51,1:18:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 修好它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry! Come on, fix it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.27,1:18:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的天啊 -  快来不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God! -  Running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.84,1:18:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快修好 -  不不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fix it, please! -  No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.45,1:18:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.52,1:19:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们成功了 我还以为我们要死了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We made it! You did it! I thought we were gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.59,1:19:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 耶 -  太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh. -  Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.89,1:19:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不错 -  谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice! -  Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.43,1:19:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢各位 -  你做到了 真是太惊险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you, guys. -  You did it. That was scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.26,1:19:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oops.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.59,1:19:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.40,1:19:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,宝石掉下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dropped the jewel.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.03,1:19:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.47,1:19:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你把宝石丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dropped the jewel?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.54,1:19:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我趴在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I leaned over,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.00,1:19:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我要吐的 结果没吐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thought I had to puke, and I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.64,1:19:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,然后它就从我包里掉出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It came out of my backpack.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.07,1:19:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们需要那个该死的宝石 -  我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We need the freaking jewel! -  I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.21,1:19:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这是最最最令人抓狂的 因为我知道我们需要它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's-that's-that's the crazy part 'cause I know we need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.21,1:19:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我们遇到大麻烦了 大麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're in a pickle. We're in a pickle.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.18,1:19:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 掉头回去 我们得把它拿回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around. We gotta go get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.95,1:19:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 就绕个弯 去找找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, let's loop around. Look for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.95,1:19:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都睁大眼睛好好找找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.11,1:19:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起把宝石找回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's all look for it as a group.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.49,1:19:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,在那儿 我看见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There! I see it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.57,1:19:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,它们在干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.20,1:20:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,它们好像在守护那颗宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like they're protecting it or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.43,1:20:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那我们怎么办 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How are we gonna do this? -  I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.94,1:20:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去拿宝石 是的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you gotta go get it, right, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.58,1:20:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要什么 要回旋镖吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you need? Your boomerang?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.51,1:20:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,还是剪刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe some scissors?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.28,1:20:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,管钳子 或者鞋带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pipe wrench? Some shoelaces?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.51,1:20:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的助手 你需要什么我就能帮你弄到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your valet. Whatever you need, I can get it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.52,1:20:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你开口就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? You just say the word.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.19,1:20:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 -  抱歉 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? -  I'm sorry, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.99,1:20:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.43,1:20:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.71,1:20:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们掉头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn us around.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.35,1:20:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.29,1:20:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.16,1:21:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 亚历克斯 准备侧着飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! -  Alex, get ready to roll us to the side.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.56,1:21:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.56,1:21:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你的时候 右翻九十度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I tell you, roll 90 degrees to the right.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.70,1:21:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就现在 翻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.10,1:21:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 你居然把我从直升机推下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pushed me out the helicopter, jackass!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.70,1:21:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.58,1:21:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 斯宾塞 你太棒了 -  谢啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Spencer, you're amazing. -  Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.31,1:21:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个出色的飞行员 亚历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a killer pilot, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.21,1:21:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢啦 -  斯宾塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. -  You too, Spencer,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.18,1:21:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你也是 你太棒了 -  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- you were incredible! -  Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.18,1:21:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 但是是他比较厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! -  ...but he was amazing, our pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.32,1:21:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你很棒 -  不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me. -  You killed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.05,1:21:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.22,1:21:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.39,1:21:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是那个当诱饵的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the one that was a human sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.46,1:21:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不知道那些犀牛底下都长了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know what's on the underside of those rhinos.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.19,1:21:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你们绝对不想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you don't wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.13,1:21:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我可都看见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.47,1:21:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至面对面感受了一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Felt them on my face too.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.44,1:21:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我这辈子都忘不掉那些东西了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things that I will never be able to erase from memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.74,1:21:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对你们来说还好笑了是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's funny to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.21,1:21:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,继续 随便笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, laugh it up. Get it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.17,1:22:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,二十年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, I've been trying to get across
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.14,1:22:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在设法穿越这片峡谷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this canyon for, like, 20 years, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.08,1:22:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道它有多大吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you realize how huge this is?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.49,1:22:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是蚊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mosquito.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.72,1:22:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 亚历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! Alex, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.38,1:22:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 亚历克斯 - 亚历克斯 不不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alex. -  Alex, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.59,1:22:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.03,1:22:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 说话 看我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, talk to me. Wake up. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.30,1:22:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他要死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex? He's dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.09,1:22:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们不能让他死 我们离成功都这么近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we can't let him die. We're too close!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.10,1:22:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有人会心肺复苏吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does anyone know how to do CPR?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.60,1:22:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我会 先按他胸口三下 然后人工呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, start with three chest compressions and mouth-to-mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.74,1:22:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.67,1:22:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么人工呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.37,1:22:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,捏住他的鼻子 打开他的嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, pinch his nose, open his mouth,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.21,1:22:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 完全封住 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- full lip-lock. -  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.48,1:22:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,呼吸一下 两下 然后重复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, one breath, two breaths, then repeat.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.11,1:22:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 亚历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.66,1:22:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,贝瑟尼 停下 你的纹身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bethany, stop. Your tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.52,1:22:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去你这是把你的一条命给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like you're giving him one of your lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.09,1:23:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm okay with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.43,1:23:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你自己需要它呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if you need it for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.20,1:23:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望亚历克斯也能回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want Alex to come home too.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.59,1:23:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么 - 亚历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? -  Alex,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.33,1:23:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,贝瑟尼把她的一条命给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bethany gave you one of her lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.76,1:23:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,贝瑟尼 你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bethany, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.12,1:23:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,应该吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.33,1:23:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,贝瑟尼 真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bethany, is that true?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.80,1:23:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你给了我一条命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave me one of your lives?
