Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.12,1:31:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.26,1:31:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想讨论那件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.76,1:31:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,行 我们得订个新计划了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we need a new plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.57,1:31:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 -  好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. -  Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.80,1:31:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 肯定的 -  斯宾塞 有什么想法吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Totally. -  Spencer, any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.97,1:31:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我能和你谈一下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I speak with you for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.87,1:31:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,现在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.27,1:32:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.21,1:32:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.74,1:32:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么 -  我就是做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you talking about? -  I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.05,1:32:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不开玩笑 我不是什么冒险家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, who am I kidding? I'm not some adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.22,1:32:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本不勇敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not actually brave.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.75,1:32:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,斯宾塞 你之前还吊在直升机外面呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spencer, I just saw you hanging out of a helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.15,1:32:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,有好几条命时 勇敢不是难事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a lot easier to be brave when you have lives to spare.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.62,1:32:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你只有一条命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a lot harder...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.09,1:32:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那可就困难得多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you only have one life.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.70,1:32:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们从来都只有一条命 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We-we always only have one life, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.20,1:32:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 生命就是只有一次 就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? That's... That's all we get. That's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.14,1:32:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是 你想怎么度过这一生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The question is, is how are you gonna live it?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.84,1:32:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你想成为怎样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which guy are you gonna decide to be?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.81,1:32:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚是引用了校长的话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I just quote our principal?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.31,1:32:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这游戏把我怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this game doing to me? I gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.91,1:32:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我得离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.18,1:32:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我们能做到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can do this, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.35,1:32:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能一起做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can do it together.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.59,1:32:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一起 -  一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Together. -  Together.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.66,1:33:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个很好的朋友 冰箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a good friend, Fridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.16,1:33:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.80,1:33:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不懂电子游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I don't know video games,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.07,1:33:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我懂橄榄球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but what I do know is football.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.33,1:33:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,外面那些狮子和吃人的大猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, those lightning-fast, man-eating cats out there?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.28,1:33:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就相当于后卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're the Defenders.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.81,1:33:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说我们要发动一轮猛攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means we gotta run one hell of an offense.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.22,1:33:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,大家注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.18,1:33:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.68,1:33:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Here's what we're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.25,1:33:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们分头行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna fan out and run a play that I call:
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.89,1:33:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,来一次冰箱之双反向传球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The Double Reverse Refrigerator."
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.16,1:33:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,贝瑟尼 你去左边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bethany, you go up the left side.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.16,1:33:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我去右边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go up the right.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.83,1:33:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 你引开对方的防守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, you'll draw the defense,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.73,1:33:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,然后斯宾塞就能走中路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so Spencer can go up the middle.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.20,1:33:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我和斯宾塞一起去 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll go with Spencer. -  No.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.10,1:33:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,需要你做另一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something else we need you to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.42,1:34:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想跳舞吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys like to dance?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.99,1:34:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.16,1:34:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,来抓我啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come and get me!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.23,1:35:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 -  没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. -  Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.27,1:35:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,去神像那 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the statue. Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.26,1:35:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哦天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! I...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.85,1:36:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.29,1:36:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,保持冷静 别慌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay calm, don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.36,1:36:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.53,1:36:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是大象就怕耗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the elephant and the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.09,1:36:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.50,1:36:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我是耗子芬巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mouse Finbar.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.47,1:36:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,动物学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zoologist.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.57,1:37:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,动物学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zoologist and...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.17,1:37:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 我包里有家伙呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And backpack guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.56,1:37:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,把宝石给我 不然你的朋友就得死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the jewel, or your friend dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.56,1:37:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要给他 -  闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't give it to him! -  Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.87,1:37:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.07,1:37:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我代替他做人质 行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take me instead, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.62,1:37:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,把宝石给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the jewel.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.25,1:37:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.58,1:37:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.42,1:37:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 四 三 -  我不能给你宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Four, three... -  I can't give you the jewel.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.88,1:37:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 斯宾塞 - 二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Spencer. -  Two!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.29,1:37:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,因为它根本不在我这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I don't have it!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.97,1:38:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,动物学家在此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zoology, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.34,1:38:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! Don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.02,1:38:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你这混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Douche bag! You suck!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.59,1:38:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是大象 -  攀爬开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Elephant. -  "Begin the climb."
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.99,1:38:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,别伤害她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.06,1:38:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你先上去 我去把宝石拿回来给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up there, I'll get the jewel to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.03,1:38:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 玛莎 -  相信我 我会拿到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Martha. -  Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.27,1:38:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 -  去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll get it to you. Go. -  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.24,1:38:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧 玛莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Martha!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.54,1:39:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.04,1:40:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,给我宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.39,1:40:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game over.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.59,1:40:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不见得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.10,1:40:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,毒液是我的弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Venom's my weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.36,1:41:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊 斯宾塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Spencer.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.37,1:41:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.38,1:41:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.79,1:41:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇哦 -  太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wow! -  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.19,1:41:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,大喊一声尤曼吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Call out its name."
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.66,1:41:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,大喊一声尤曼吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call out its name!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.80,1:41:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 大家一起喊尤曼吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call out its name, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.53,1:41:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,尤曼吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jumanji!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.14,1:41:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,尤曼吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jumanji!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.44,1:42:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得我们成功了 -  我们通关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think we did it. -  I think we won.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.51,1:42:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we did.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.41,1:42:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,快看 是奈吉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, it's Nigel.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.58,1:42:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,奈吉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nigel.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.39,1:42:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,做得好 勇敢的冒险者们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, intrepid adventurers!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.73,1:42:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你们解除了诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lifted the curse!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.22,1:43:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我代表尤曼吉感谢你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of Jumanji thanks you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.53,1:43:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的任务完成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your work here is done.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.83,1:43:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真是遗憾 我们要告别了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, sadly, this is where we part.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.79,1:43:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,水上飞机家 麦克多诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seaplane McDonough,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.66,1:43:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,让我和你握个手道别吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let me shake your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.57,1:43:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.67,1:43:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 奥布伦教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adieu, Professor Oberon.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.88,1:43:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Later, dude.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.49,1:43:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我会最想念你 小耗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll miss you the most, my little Mouse.
